      "name": "mkDerivation",
      "description": "This function creates a derivation, and returns it in the form of an\nattribute set that both looks like a derivation and can be built.\n\n# Arguments\n\nThe single argument is an attribute set describing the package.\n\n# Example\n\n```nix\nmkDerivation {\n  name = \"hello\";\n  src = ./.;\n}\n```",
